Sources (sub2api-nailao)

This project is a modified version of Sub2API by Wei-Shaw and contributors
(https://github.com/Wei-Shaw/sub2api). It is distributed under the same
licence as Sub2API, the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3; the full
text is in the LICENSE file, which is unchanged from upstream.

Upstream baseline
    The upstream tag and commit this tree is based on are recorded in
    .upstream-sub2api.

Modifications
    Every upstream file that this project changes is listed in
    docs/sources/CORE-PATCHES.json with its SHA-256 and the reason for the
    change, and CI verifies that list against the baseline. SOURCES.md
    describes the changes feature by feature. Code that exists only in this
    project lives mainly under extensions/, scripts/ and deploy/sources/.

Corresponding source
    Published container images are labelled with the revision they were built
    from. The corresponding source for an image is that revision of this
    repository.
